OL,7,     Fdamage in an assault over a pay
OL,8,     Fdispute, a secret recording blows
OL,9,     Fthe case wide open, forcing
OL,10,     Fdetectives to question everything
OL,11,     Fthey thought they knew.
OL,12,G2200 Cause of Death
OL,13,     FSenior Coroner Dr James Adeley
OL,14,     Finvestigates the mysterious death
OL,15,     Fof Jake, in his 20s, to determine
OL,16,     Fif anything suspicious is at play,
OL,17,     Fto peel back the layers behind his
OL,18,     Ftragic death.
