OL,5,G2305 Murder Scene: The Incident Room
OL,6,     FAfter 81-year-old Colin Dunford is
OL,7,     Ffound murdered in his living room,
OL,8,     Fdetectives find a scene of
OL,9,     Fshocking violence and launch an
OL,10,     Furgent hunt before the perpetrator
OL,11,     Fstrikes again.
OL,12,G0005 Motorway Cops: Catching Britain's
OL,13,G     Speeders
OL,14,     FAn M6 pursuit turns dangerous as a
OL,15,     Fprovisional driver hits 100mph.
OL,16,     FElsewhere, police stop an unsafe
OL,17,     Ftruck and catch a fuel thief who
OL,18,     Ftests positive for cocaine.
